{
  "_comment": [
    "A oneshot service that creates the development account on a fresh machine.",
    "",
    "!! THE ACCOUNT HAS NO CREDENTIAL AND IS THEREFORE OPEN TO ANY CALLER. !!",
    "See /usr/libexec/lpsd/first-account. This belongs on a live",
    "or development image and nowhere else; a production image simply does not",
    "list this file in [registry] autoapply, provisions an empty store, and has",
    "an administrator run `lps add` for the first account.",
    "",
    "Why a service and not an autorun script: autoruns run in Phase 1.5, before",
    "peinit starts any service, so lpsd is not listening yet. `lps` talks to lpsd",
    "over /run/lpsd/admin.sock, so the work has to happen after lpsd is up --",
    "which is what Requires expresses.",
    "",
    "Readiness is Alive (1) rather than Notify (0): the script does not speak the",
    "notify protocol, it just exits. Type Oneshot (1) with RestartPolicy Never",
    "(0) says run it once and do not bring it back. ErrorControl stays Normal so",
    "a failure is a warning rather than a boot abort -- an image that cannot",
    "create its demo account should still boot far enough to be debugged.",
    "",
    "Identity is stated rather than left to a default: `lps` accepts SYSTEM",
    "BUILTIN\\Administrators precisely for this case: at first boot there is no",
    "administrator yet, which is the problem this service exists to solve.",
    "",
    "No self-deletion and no idempotence guard. A live image is tmpfs, so every",
    "boot provisions a fresh store and this runs against an empty one; an",
    "installed system loses both this key and the script when the installer",
    "commits the filesystem to disk.",
    "",
    "Shipped by dev.peios.authd-live-account into /usr/share/regim/; it applies",
    "only if an image opts in via [registry] autoapply in its peiso.toml."
  ],
  "keys": [
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\lpsd-first-account",
      "values": [
        { "name": "ImagePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/usr/libexec/lpsd/first-account" },
        { "name": "Type", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "Triggers", "type": "multi", "data": ["boot"] },
        { "name": "Requires", "type": "multi", "data": ["lpsd"] },
        { "name": "Identity", "type": "sz", "data": "SYSTEM" },
        { "name": "Readiness", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "RestartPolicy", "type": "dword", "data": 0 },
        { "name": "ErrorControl", "type": "dword", "data": 0 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
